@startuml deployment
title Deployment — api + postgres via compose

skinparam shadowing false

cloud Clients
node "Docker host" {
  node "api :8080" {
    [nginx :8080] as nginx
    [php-fpm :9000\n(Laravel 11 / PHP 8.3)] as fpm
  }
  database "postgres :5432" as pg {
    folder "pgdata\n(volume)"
  }
}

Clients --> nginx : HTTPS
nginx --> fpm : fastcgi
fpm --> pg : DB_HOST=postgres
note right of fpm
  supervisord runs nginx + php-fpm
  in one container. App is also
  fine behind any reverse proxy
  in production.
end note
@enduml
